Every later lesson reads and writes small C programs, so start with the language itself. Here is a complete one:

```
#include <stdio.h>

int main(void) {
    int apples = 7;
    printf("%d apples\n", apples);
    return 0;
}
```

It prints `7 apples`. Every piece of it is explained below.

